#. §0: $$ P ∧ T₀ ↔ P $$
#. §1: $T₀$
#. §2: $$
#. \\begin{array}{|cc||c|}
#.   \\hline
#.   P & T₀ & P ∧ T₀ \\
#.   \\hline
#.   T & T & T \\
#.   F & T & F \\
#.   \\hline
#. \\end{array}
#. $$
#: Game.Levels.EquivWorld.EquivWorld_eg.equiv_eg_docs
msgid "This is an **Identity Law**. It says that\n"
"\n"
"§0\n"
"\n"
"where §1 is a tautology. We can prove the **Identity Law** with a truth-table:\n"
