#. §1: `P`
#. §2: `by_cases h : P`
#. §3: `h : P`
#. §4: `h : ¬ P`
#: Game.Levels.PfWorld.pf_docs
msgid "The §0 tactic will split the goal into two cases. Specifically, if §1 is a proposition (supplied by the player), then §2 will add the hypothesis §3 to the first case while adding the hypothesis §4 to the second case."
msgstr ""

#: Game.Levels.QuantifierWorld.L07_quant
msgid "Forall distributes over and"
