">\n"
"If §0, then the **subset** relation §1, illustrated above, is defined as follows:\n"
"§2\n"
"The curly braces around the first §3 indicate that Lean considers this argument to be *implicit*. This means that Lean will infer what §4 is from the argument §5. 👉 Try\n"
