#: Game.Levels.QuantifierWorld.QuantifierWorld_eg.quant_eg_docs
msgid "The tactic §0 is used to destructure hypotheses or expressions. General usage looks like §1 where §2 is a pattern matched against §3. For example, suppose §4. Usual usage might be\n"
